msgid "Scan date (Only last changes or All history) - You can choose whether to retrieve only the most recent change or the entire history."
msgstr "Umhla woskeno (Utshintsho lokugqibela kuphela okanye yonke imbali) - Ungakhetha ukuba ufuna ukufumana utshintsho lwakutshanje kuphela okanye yonke imbali."

