#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How often gather data"
msgstr "Qokelela idatha kangaphi"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If enabled, Evidence will gather data periodically. If disabled, you can only view data for specific host"
msgstr "Ukuba ivuliwe, i-Evidence iya kuqokelela idatha ngamaxesha athile. Ukuba icinyiwe, unokujonga kuphela idatha yehosti ethile"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "Icinyiwe"

#: includes/settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "Every %d hours"
msgstr "Rhoqo ngeeyure ezi-%d"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every day"
msgstr "Yonke imihla"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Every week"
msgstr "Rhoqo ngeveki"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "When evidence will be started"
msgstr "Xa ubungqina buza kuqaliswa"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "The Base Time for gather data to occur.  For example, if you use '12:00am' and you choose once per day, the action would begin at approximately midnight every day."
msgstr "IXesha eliSisiseko lokuqokelela idatha. Umzekelo, ukuba usebenzisa u-'12:00am' kwaye ukhethe kanye ngosuku, inyathelo liya kuqala malunga nenzulu yobusuku yonke imihla."

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "How many changes store in database"
msgstr "Zingaphi iinguqu eziza kugcinwa kwiziko ledatha"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "If data gathering is enabled,  you can specify how many history (changed) records keep for each device"
