#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Excluded notification Host IDs"
msgstr "I-ID zeHosti zesaziso ezishiywe ngaphandle"

#: includes/settings.php
msgid "Some devices report hw changes too often. You can exclude these host from email notification. Insert Host IDs, comma separator"
msgstr "Ezinye izixhobo zixela utshintsho lwe-hw rhoqo kakhulu. Unokuzikhuphela ngaphandle ezi hosti kwisaziso se-imeyile. Faka ii-ID zeehosti, uhlule ngekoma"

